        "revision": "023dae9732c50a4ed9bd573f6d385b0b54129ce6"
      },
      "notes": {
        "summary": "The workbench has a command: `openmw-workbench [folder...]` reviews an OpenMW Lua mod's scripts.",
        "added": [
          "The `openmw-workbench` command: a review of the Lua mod in each folder, the working directory when none is named, as text or JSON, with `--profile` and `--content`. It exits 1 when the review found an error, so CI can stop on one.",
          "`@openmw-install/workbench/commands`: the same review as a typed request and a typed result."
        ]
      },
